<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for the VixenBliss Agency digital visual content platform."
>
  <p>
    VixenBliss Agency is a digital platform for visual content, creative media experiences, and avatar-based
    storytelling. This Privacy Policy explains how basic site information may be handled when visitors use the
    website.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We may collect limited information connected to site operation and visitor experience, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>basic technical data such as browser type, device type, language, and approximate region;</li>
    <li>site interaction data such as page views, navigation events, and link selections;</li>
    <li>performance and availability signals used to keep the website reliable.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
  <p>We use this information to improve the visitor experience, optimize site performance, and understand general usage patterns.</p>

  <h2>Service Providers</h2>
  <p>
    The website may rely on Bunny Stream for video delivery and Directus for content management. These providers
    process technical information as needed to deliver and manage the site experience.
  </p>

  <h2>External Links</h2>
  <p>
    Some links may direct visitors to other websites. Those websites operate under their own policies and practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy inquiries or legal requests, contact <a href="mailto:support@vixenbliss.com">support@vixenbliss.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
